<title>FRANCE: Block of Vallourec stock trades at 295 Ffr.</title>
<headline>Block of Vallourec stock trades at 295 Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of 137,211 Vallourec shares traded at 295 francs per share at 0903 GMT, the SBF stock markets association said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The shares closed at 310 francs on Monday.</p>
<p>The block represented 1.6 percent of Vallourec's capital.</p>
<p>The company earlier announced 1996 net profit of 195 million francs, up from 85 million in 1995 and expects a further increase for 1997.</p>
<p>Usinor-Sacilor said on Monday it is selling 21 percent of Vallourec.</p>
</text>
